+/*
+ * fajita (patches/xnu/fajita-pcpu.patch). pcpu=<mask> seeds every pset's perfcontrol preferred and migration
+ * bitmasks (pset_init), which the edge scheduler's CLPC sets on Apple parts: choose_processor() then takes an
+ * idle CPU of the mask first and passes over an idle hint outside it, and the clutch thread_avoid_processor()
+ * moves a timeshare thread off a CPU outside the mask at quantum expiry while a CPU of the mask is idle.
+ * rcpu=<mask> instead recommends only the CPUs of the mask (sched_pcpu_tick, a measurement aid). Both are
